Comment: 0,0:00:00.95,0:01:01.03,OP,,0,0,0,,Abertura
Comment: 0,0:01:01.03,0:03:51.32,OP,,0,0,0,,Afinação
Comment: 0,0:03:51.32,0:03:51.36,OP,,0,0,0,,Água Embaixo da Ponte
Comment: 0,0:07:13.02,0:09:26.82,OP,,0,0,0,,Prova
Comment: 0,0:12:25.96,0:12:30.97,OP,,0,0,0,,Prévia
Dialogue: 20,0:01:03.79,0:01:04.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Takase!
Dialogue: 20,0:01:08.53,0:01:12.76,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ultimamente, não consigo tirar meus olhos do Sugawara-kun.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:13.31,0:01:14.97,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an1\i1}O que há de errado comigo?
Dialogue: 20,0:01:16.64,0:01:18.04,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2}Chii-chan?
Dialogue: 20,0:01:18.44,0:01:20.34,Main,,0,0,0,,O que foi? Você está estranha ultimamente.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:20.34,0:01:21.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Está com algum problema?
Dialogue: 20,0:01:21.79,0:01:24.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, não é nada.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:24.80,0:01:26.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Você está apaixonada?
Dialogue: 20,0:01:29.23,0:01:30.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã? É isso mesmo, Chii-chan?
Dialogue: 20,0:01:30.62,0:01:32.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Quê? Não, Yo-chan.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:32.27,0:01:34.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Não sei nada dessas coisas de amor.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:34.18,0:01:36.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas você não tem vontade de saber vendo as pessoas ao seu redor?
Dialogue: 20,0:01:36.56,0:01:39.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Especialmente o Gouda-kun com a Ayaka-chan.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:39.19,0:01:41.12,Main,,0,0,0,,E-Eu não...
Dialogue: 20,0:01:43.92,0:01:47.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Nossa, acabamos de falar de você, Ayaka-chan.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:47.59,0:01:49.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Sério? Sobre o quê?
Dialogue: 20,0:01:49.33,0:01:52.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Ayaka-chan, como você começou a sair com o Gouda-kun?
Dialogue: 20,0:01:52.67,0:01:54.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Você quer saber também, não é, Chii-chan?
Dialogue: 20,0:01:54.95,0:01:56.46,Main,,0,0,0,,N-Não.
Dialogue: 20,0:01:56.46,0:01:58.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Precisa de alguma coisa, Ayaka-chan?
Dialogue: 20,0:01:58.70,0:02:01.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, sim, estava procurando o Sensei.
Dialogue: 20,0:02:01.77,0:02:04.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Não podemos conversar só um pouquinho?
Dialogue: 20,0:02:04.20,0:02:06.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Não devemos bisbilhotar assim.
Dialogue: 20,0:02:06.01,0:02:08.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Bom, se é apenas um pouco...
Dialogue: 20,0:02:10.56,0:02:12.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos, não está curiosa, Chii-chan?
Dialogue: 20,0:02:12.31,0:02:13.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu não me importo.
Dialogue: 20,0:02:13.04,0:02:15.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Certo, então quem se confessou primeiro?
Dialogue: 20,0:02:15.00,0:02:17.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Quê? Isso é embaraçoso...
Dialogue: 20,0:02:17.80,0:02:19.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Bom, fui eu.
Dialogue: 20,0:02:21.49,0:02:22.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, Chii-chan.
Dialogue: 20,0:02:22.62,0:02:24.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Você está interessada, né?
Dialogue: 20,0:02:24.00,0:02:24.91,Main,,0,0,0,,N-Não.
Dialogue: 20,0:02:24.91,0:02:27.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã? Você também gosta de alguém?
Dialogue: 20,0:02:27.36,0:02:29.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Ela não para de suspirar ultimamente.
Dialogue: 20,0:02:29.26,0:02:30.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Não estou!
Dialogue: 20,0:02:30.17,0:02:32.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, mas eu era assim também.
Dialogue: 20,0:02:33.74,0:02:36.61,Main,,0,0,0,,É assim que ficamos quando gostamos de alguém.
Dialogue: 20,0:02:36.61,0:02:37.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Não é?
Dialogue: 20,0:02:37.58,0:02:39.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu não estou gostando de ninguém.
Dialogue: 20,0:02:40.44,0:02:44.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu ficava seguindo o Gouda-kun com meus olhos, sem perceber,
Dialogue: 20,0:02:44.10,0:02:46.62,Main,,0,0,0,,ou pensando nele sem notar.
Dialogue: 20,0:02:46.62,0:02:48.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Fazia isso na hora do clube também.
Dialogue: 20,0:02:48.76,0:02:51.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Chii-chan, não está gostando de alguém?
Dialogue: 20,0:02:55.72,0:02:58.95,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O Sugawara-kun é apenas um colega de classe.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:00.67,0:03:03.46,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ele é gentil com todo mundo.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:03.46,0:03:05.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Será que é o Sugawara-kun?
Dialogue: 20,0:03:05.28,0:03:06.50,Main,,0,0,0,,É ele?
Dialogue: 20,0:03:06.50,0:03:07.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Não é.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:07.63,0:03:09.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Além disso, por que acha que é o Sugawara-kun?
Dialogue: 20,0:03:09.69,0:03:12.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, não, é que ouvi um rumor por aí.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:13.39,0:03:15.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Que ele gosta de você.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:15.60,0:03:19.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouvi... esse rumor... também.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:19.75,0:03:23.31,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O Sugawara-kun gosta de mim...?
Dialogue: 20,0:03:23.82,0:03:25.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O Sugawara-kun...
Dialogue: 20,0:03:26.37,0:03:28.05,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O Sugawara-kun...
Dialogue: 20,0:03:28.28,0:03:29.01,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O Suga—
Dialogue: 20,0:03:30.01,0:03:32.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Claro, é apenas um rumor.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:32.33,0:03:34.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas talvez se você se confessar para ele...
Dialogue: 20,0:03:34.32,0:03:36.11,Main,,0,0,0,,E-Eu não vou, nem pensar.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:37.19,0:03:40.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Aliás, como você se confessou, Ayaka-chan?
Dialogue: 20,0:03:40.02,0:03:41.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Bom...
Dialogue: 20,0:03:45.82,0:03:47.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Enfim, vamos treinar.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:52.88,0:03:55.28,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Minha namorada terminou comigo.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:56.12,0:03:57.29,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Quero morrer.
Dialogue: 20,0:03:58.12,0:03:59.94,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não podemos voltar?
Dialogue: 20,0:04:02.55,0:04:04.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Kana, sobre o que aconteceu aquele dia...
Dialogue: 20,0:04:04.21,0:04:05.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:05.59,0:04:06.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas o Chiaki...
Dialogue: 20,0:04:06.65,0:04:07.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Deixa ele.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:07.14,0:04:07.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:14.48,0:04:15.55,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Quero morrer.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:17.14,0:04:19.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Quê? Vocês terminaram?
Dialogue: 20,0:04:19.37,0:04:22.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Por causa do jeito estranho que ele me deu o primeiro beijo.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:22.01,0:04:25.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Concordo que ele estragou tudo, \Nmas tem certeza que quer terminar?
Dialogue: 20,0:04:27.90,0:04:28.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:28.46,0:04:29.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Ele não vale a pena.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:33.40,0:04:34.93,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nada de resposta ainda.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:34.93,0:04:36.44,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nem marcado como lido.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:37.47,0:04:39.75,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Acho que vou parar de mandar mensagem para ela.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:41.25,0:04:42.76,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Estou ignorando ele.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:42.76,0:04:44.88,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mas será que já posso perdoá-lo?
Dialogue: 20,0:04:44.88,0:04:47.75,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não é como se o Chiaki tivesse feito por mal.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:48.56,0:04:49.14,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Certo.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:49.14,0:04:51.59,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se ela não responder dessa vez, eu desisto.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:51.59,0:04:54.59,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se ele se desculpar, mais uma vez, eu o perdoo.
Dialogue: 20,0:04:58.66,0:05:00.11,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Talvez seja melhor uma carta maior?
Dialogue: 20,0:05:00.11,0:05:01.93,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Isso seria estranho?
Dialogue: 20,0:05:03.94,0:05:06.31,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ele tem mandado mensagens todos os dias.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:06.31,0:05:08.61,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Por que não manda hoje?
Dialogue: 20,0:05:08.61,0:05:10.44,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Peça desculpas logo, idiota.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:12.82,0:05:15.18,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Isso, essa é a melhor maneira.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:15.18,0:05:16.95,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Quero me desculpar diretamente se for possível.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:29.29,0:05:30.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Qual é!
Dialogue: 20,0:05:30.63,0:05:32.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Só pode estar brincando!
Dialogue: 20,0:05:40.50,0:05:42.81,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O que ele queria?!
Dialogue: 20,0:05:44.38,0:05:46.23,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ela não está respondendo.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:46.23,0:05:48.94,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ela não larga o telefone nem quando vai tomar banho.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:48.94,0:05:50.90,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ela está me ignorando.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:51.30,0:05:52.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}T-Tudo bem.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:52.50,0:05:54.23,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tenho certeza de que ele estava se desculpando.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:54.23,0:05:55.74,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}É só eu responder amanhã.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:57.22,0:05:59.20,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vou desistir.
Dialogue: 20,0:05:59.70,0:06:02.45,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mas, o que farei se o Chiaki desistir por causa disso?
Dialogue: 20,0:06:03.03,0:06:05.74,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Depois de todo esse tempo sendo ignorado, ele deve ter desistido.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:05.74,0:06:07.21,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ele deve me odiar agora.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:07.95,0:06:09.68,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não quero que ele me odeie.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:09.68,0:06:13.21,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ele me irrita às vezes, mas eu gosto dele.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:14.08,0:06:15.95,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Quero me desculpar.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:16.44,0:06:17.41,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Por favor.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:17.41,0:06:18.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Liga.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:19.11,0:06:20.30,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Liga.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:21.11,0:06:22.66,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Liga!
Dialogue: 20,0:06:24.10,0:06:26.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Kana, vai sair daí algum dia?
Dialogue: 20,0:06:26.94,0:06:29.55,Main,,0,0,0,,O que está fazendo pelada assim?
Dialogue: 20,0:06:30.99,0:06:33.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Derrubei meu celular na banheira.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:34.10,0:06:36.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso não é nada, é só dar um tapinha.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:37.57,0:06:38.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Pare, mãe!
Dialogue: 20,0:06:38.63,0:06:40.30,Main,,0,0,0,,E se ele ficar pior?
Dialogue: 20,0:06:41.60,0:06:42.83,Main,,0,0,0,,M-Mentira!
Dialogue: 20,0:06:42.83,0:06:44.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Sou boa com máquinas.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:44.40,0:06:45.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Obrigada, mãe.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:47.63,0:06:50.02,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não posso desistir.
Dialogue: 20,0:06:50.02,0:06:51.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vou me desculpar!
Dialogue: 20,0:06:51.50,0:06:53.42,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ele não desistiu ainda!
Dialogue: 20,0:06:53.42,0:06:54.92,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Atenda, Kana!
Dialogue: 20,0:06:55.29,0:06:56.51,Main,,0,0,0,,{\pos(495,1020)}Chiaki!
Dialogue: 20,0:06:56.51,0:06:57.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Alô?
Dialogue: 20,0:07:01.93,0:07:03.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Ela desligou!
Dialogue: 20,0:07:03.04,0:07:04.25,Main,,0,0,0,,O que foi isso?
Dialogue: 20,0:07:04.25,0:07:07.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem, vou te bloquear também, idiota!
Dialogue: 20,0:07:08.32,0:07:09.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Que foi? Desligou de novo?
Dialogue: 20,0:07:09.94,0:07:11.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Esse é o problema das máquinas!
Dialogue: 20,0:07:14.26,0:07:18.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã? Esqueci meu grafite?
Dialogue: 20,0:07:18.63,0:07:20.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Achei que tinha trazido.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:22.26,0:07:23.27,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se...
Dialogue: 20,0:07:23.27,0:07:27.36,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se eu der um grafite para ela, \Nvai parecer que tem intenção por trás?
Dialogue: 20,0:07:27.36,0:07:29.42,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se eu pedir um grafite pro Takase, ao invés das minhas amigas,
Dialogue: 20,0:07:29.42,0:07:33.38,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}será que vai parecer que estou com segundas intenções?
Dialogue: 20,0:07:37.15,0:07:40.79,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bom, quero dizer, eu tenho uma intenção.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:40.79,0:07:42.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Certo, todos em seus lugares.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:42.78,0:07:44.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Yuki-chan, pode me emprestar um grafite?
Dialogue: 20,0:07:44.90,0:07:48.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, meu grafite é 0.4.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:49.30,0:07:51.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Por que não pede para o Takase-kun?
Dialogue: 20,0:07:51.15,0:07:52.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Você se senta ao lado dele.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:52.67,0:07:53.81,Main,,0,0,0,,É, bom...
Dialogue: 20,0:07:54.40,0:07:56.17,Main,,0,0,0,,É a sua chance de se aproximar.
Dialogue: 20,0:07:56.17,0:07:57.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, não comece com isso!
Dialogue: 20,0:08:04.19,0:08:06.98,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Droga, o grafite já acabou.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:06.98,0:08:08.45,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Devia ter pedido para o Takase.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:14.61,0:08:15.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Pronto, acabou o tempo.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:15.94,0:08:17.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Passem a folha de resposta para a frente.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:21.47,0:08:23.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Obrigada pelo grafite.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:23.26,0:08:25.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Claro. Sem problemas.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:25.03,0:08:26.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Te dou outro depois.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:26.16,0:08:27.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Não tem problema.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:28.47,0:08:31.18,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Por que eles não namoram?
Dialogue: 20,0:08:32.65,0:08:33.69,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hum...
Dialogue: 20,0:08:34.35,0:08:37.09,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A resposta de ax = b é...
Dialogue: 20,0:08:37.09,0:08:38.63,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}x =...
Dialogue: 20,0:08:38.63,0:08:40.85,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Espere, isso está errado?
Dialogue: 20,0:08:40.85,0:08:42.51,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Você quer ir para a faculdade?
Dialogue: 20,0:08:42.51,0:08:43.87,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Você já está no terceiro ano.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:44.41,0:08:46.45,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não acha que está tarde para estudar?
Dialogue: 20,0:08:46.45,0:08:49.03,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}É-É por isso que estou estudando agora!
Dialogue: 20,0:08:49.03,0:08:50.95,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mas não temos dinheiro.
Dialogue: 20,0:08:50.95,0:08:53.06,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ir para a faculdade é uma coisa, mas uma particular?
Dialogue: 20,0:08:53.06,0:08:54.44,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}E-Eu sei!
Dialogue: 20,0:08:54.44,0:08:55.56,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}É por isso...
Dialogue: 20,0:08:55.56,0:08:57.60,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Foi isso que disse para minha mãe,
Dialogue: 20,0:08:57.60,0:09:00.91,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mas vou conseguir entrar numa \Nfaculdade pública estudando agora?
Dialogue: 20,0:09:06.45,0:09:07.31,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Merda.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:07.31,0:09:10.43,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eu ignorei ou dormi em todas as provas até agora.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:12.65,0:09:14.35,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Agora que estou levando a sério,
Dialogue: 20,0:09:15.17,0:09:18.65,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}todos ao meu redor parecem melhores que eu.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:25.53,0:09:28.37,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Acho que comecei muito tarde mesmo.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:30.71,0:09:31.71,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se concentre!
Dialogue: 20,0:09:31.71,0:09:32.87,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se concentre, droga!
Dialogue: 20,0:09:35.48,0:09:38.01,Main,,0,0,0,,A Kaji sempre foi tão estudiosa assim?
Dialogue: 20,0:09:38.01,0:09:40.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim, estou surpresa também.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:40.04,0:09:42.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Ela finalmente percebeu que as provas estão chegando.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:42.41,0:09:43.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Você deveria aprender com ela, Kyouko-san—
Dialogue: 20,0:09:43.85,0:09:44.87,Main,,0,0,0,,É o namorado dela.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:46.23,0:09:48.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Quero dizer, ela não está namorando o presidente do conselho estudantil?
Dialogue: 20,0:09:48.64,0:09:49.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Você não sabia?
Dialogue: 20,0:09:54.02,0:09:58.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Masafumi, sua namorada parece nervosa.
Dialogue: 20,0:09:58.50,0:09:59.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Não vai falar com ela?
Dialogue: 20,0:10:00.81,0:10:01.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso é parte do treino dela.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:02.19,0:10:03.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Ela estará sozinha na prova.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:06.27,0:10:10.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Você diz isso, mas é você quem está tentando não se apavorar.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:10.91,0:10:14.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Pode me bater se eu for falar com ela.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:14.05,0:10:15.16,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Estralo.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:16.66,0:10:17.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Vou passar as impressões.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:17.72,0:10:18.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Todos sentados.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:18.67,0:10:20.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}F-Fique calma.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:20.50,0:10:22.58,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pense no que aprendeu com o Akagi-dono!
Dialogue: 20,0:10:22.58,0:10:24.17,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ryouko-chan, essa questão aqui...
Dialogue: 20,0:10:24.17,0:10:25.43,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hã? Está errada?
Dialogue: 20,0:10:25.43,0:10:27.42,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Posso beijar você quando acabar?
Dialogue: 20,0:10:27.42,0:10:28.72,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1\fad(0,810)}Morra.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:30.37,0:10:31.55,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vamos esquecer isso.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:37.06,0:10:38.06,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Terminei.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:40.79,0:10:43.17,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I-Isso está certo?
Dialogue: 20,0:10:43.17,0:10:45.25,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Acho que respondi isso, mas...
Dialogue: 20,0:10:45.25,0:10:46.23,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Respondi?
Dialogue: 20,0:10:47.49,0:10:48.97,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não, eu sei essa.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:48.97,0:10:50.75,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eu refiz isso várias vezes.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:50.75,0:10:53.58,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vou passar nessa prova e ir para a faculdade com o Akagi.
Dialogue: 20,0:10:57.50,0:10:59.04,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Então...
Dialogue: 20,0:10:59.04,0:11:01.43,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O que se faz nessas situações mesmo?
Dialogue: 20,0:11:02.40,0:11:04.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah, é. Fale com o professor.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:08.02,0:11:10.65,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Será que os outros...
Dialogue: 20,0:11:11.16,0:11:14.51,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}vão me achar estranha se eu levantar a mão?
Dialogue: 20,0:11:15.00,0:11:17.17,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Tem uma delinquente fazendo a prova".
Dialogue: 20,0:11:17.17,0:11:19.02,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Ela está tentando ir para a faculdade".
Dialogue: 20,0:11:19.93,0:11:21.21,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Claro.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:21.94,0:11:24.56,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não importa o quanto eu tente.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:24.56,0:11:27.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Sensei, poderia pegar essa borracha?
Dialogue: 20,0:11:28.45,0:11:29.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, claro.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:29.93,0:11:31.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Deixa-me ver...
Dialogue: 20,0:11:31.14,0:11:32.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, não é minha.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:32.93,0:11:34.33,Main,,0,0,0,,É da Kaji-san.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:34.33,0:11:35.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kaji.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:35.41,0:11:37.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Vejo que está se esforçando dessa vez.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:37.41,0:11:38.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Aqui está.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:38.65,0:11:40.03,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Obrigada.
Dialogue: 20,0:11:41.51,0:11:44.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu também estou torcendo por você!
Dialogue: 20,0:12:00.78,0:12:01.75,Main,,0,0,0,,O que foi, Kaji?
Dialogue: 20,0:12:01.75,0:12:03.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Está se sentindo mal?
Dialogue: 20,0:12:03.40,0:12:04.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 20,0:12:04.33,0:12:04.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Não é nada.
Dialogue: 20,0:12:04.96,0:12:06.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Foi algo que eu disse?
Dialogue: 20,0:12:06.71,0:12:08.06,Main,,0,0,0,,N-Não!
Dialogue: 20,0:12:08.06,0:12:09.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Quer ir para a enfermaria?
Dialogue: 20,0:12:09.21,0:12:10.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Estou bem!
Dialogue: 20,0:12:10.56,0:12:14.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Sensei, quero dormir na enfermaria também...
Dialogue: 20,0:12:14.32,0:12:15.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, pare, Sano.
Dialogue: 20,0:12:19.27,0:12:21.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Voltem para a prova.
Dialogue: 20,0:12:28.05,0:12:30.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Próximo episódio: O Verão Está Começando.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ShikawaSigns,,0,0,0,,
